#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_open.rst:5
msgid "Open element editor"
msgstr "打开元素编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_open.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows displaying the element editor PopUp window by creating a"
" new element or by editing an existing element."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许通过创建新元素或编辑已有元素来显示元素编辑器PopUp窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_open.rst:11
msgid "Creating a new element"
msgstr "创建新元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_open.rst:13
msgid ""
"Refers to the section **link** for opening the element editor by creating a "
"new element from the project panel."
msgstr "指通过从项目面板中创建新元素来打开元素编辑器的 **链接** 节。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_open.rst:16
msgid "Editing an element"
msgstr "编辑元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_open.rst:18
msgid ""
"Refers to the section **Link** for opening the element editor by editing an "
"element from collection."
msgstr "参考 **Link** 节，通过编辑集合中的元素来打开元素编辑器。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_open.rst:19
msgid ""
"Refers to section **Link** for opening the element editor by editing an "
"element from the workspace."
msgstr "参考 **Link** 节，通过编辑工作空间中的元素打开元素编辑器。"
